# The Config tab: crossfade, loudness, data saver… each changed with ← → and kept.
Output docs/config.gif
Source tapes/style.tape

Hide
Type "tapes/demo.sh"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show

Sleep 1s
# to Config
Tab@500ms 5
Sleep 2s
# crossfade 4 s
Right@700ms 2
Sleep 1s
Down
# even out loudness: on
Right
Sleep 1s
Down
# data saver
Right
Sleep 2s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
